  - 'Try more light: turn towards a window, or switch the flashlight on.'
  - Wipe the camera lens with a soft cloth.
  - Hold the phone steady, about 15 to 20 cm from the label, and let it focus.
  - Still nothing? Tap Type it in and write the product's name.
  stuckTipSeconds: 4
  pulseManualButtonWhenStuck: 1
  manualPulseSize: 0.05
  finishNormalLabel: Finish
  finishUnnamedLabel: Finish anyway
  statusScanning: Recognizing the product...
  statusPaused: Paused. Tap once to continue.
  statusIdle: Tap once to start scanning.
  statusDone: Got it! Analysing the product now...
  hintDark: It is too dark. Turn on the flashlight or move to the light.
  hintMoving: Hold steadier
  hintGlare: Tilt slightly, there is glare
  hintBlurry: Move a little back so the text is sharp
  hintFront: 'Show the front: the brand and the product''s name'
  hintIngredients: Checking Firebase first, then trusted product sources if needed.
  hintIngredientsMore: Tap Look it up to retry the Firebase and trusted-source search.
  hintCodes: Show the barcode (on the bottom or the back)
  hintShade: Show the shade's name or number
  hintAround: Show one clear view of the product. No extra angles are needed.
  hintAllDone: Product recognized.
  hintBrand: 'The brand is not read yet: show the brand name on the front'
  hintName: 'Now the product''s name: hold the front steady, with the name inside
    the frame'
  hintKind: Show where the pack says what it is (lipstick, foundation, powder...)
  hintBarcode: Almost done. Show the barcode too if the pack has one
  ingredientsFoundFormat: '{0} ingredients read'
  ingredientsReadingFormat: '{0} ingredients so far'
  ingredientsLookedUpFormat: '{0} ingredients found'
  msgStarting: Starting the camera...
  msgAiLooking: This product is new to GlowUp. Recognising it takes a little longer
    the first time...
  similarTitle: Is it one of these?
  similarMessage: We read the name and the brand but not the kind of make-up or the
    shade. Tap the product if it is one of these, for a faster and surer result.
  similarNoneLabel: None of these
  msgNoSimilar: No similar product is saved. Try scanning again, or tap Finish to
    go on with what was read.
  msgNotSure: We could not name this product. Type its name, start over, or tap Finish
    anyway.
  msgAiLimit: The AI has been asked as often as it may be for now. Type the product's
    name, or tap Finish anyway.
  msgNeedList: The product's ingredient list is not available yet. Tap Look it up
    or try again.
  msgStalled: Not getting further? Tap Start over, or tap Type it in.
  msgPauseReset: The scan was paused for a while, so it was put back to the start.
  msgDifferentProduct: 'That is a different product: a new scan was started for it.'
  msgSameAgain: Scanning the same product again. Its name is kept.
  msgStartedOver: Ready for a new product.
  msgReaderMissing: The text reader is not available on this device. Type the product
    and brand instead.
  msgManualNothing: Type the product's name (its brand helps), or its ingredient
    list.
  msgManualLooking: Looking for {0}...
  msgManualNoList: No matching product with ingredients was found for {0}. Check
    the spelling and brand.
  msgLookUpNeedsName: Show the front of the product first, so we know which product
    to look up.
  msgLookingUp: Searching GlowUp's Firebase product catalogue...
  msgFirebaseMiss: No matching product or verified ingredient list was found. Check
    the product name, or type it in.
  msgFirebaseNoIngredients: GlowUp found this product, but its ingredient list is
    not saved in the catalogue yet.
  msgFirebaseUnavailable: GlowUp's product catalogue could not be reached. Check
    your connection and try again.
  msgCheckingOnline: "Not in our catalog yet. Checking product pages online\u2026"
  msgFoundOnline: "Found ingredient list \xB7 Unverified source"
  msgNeedBrand: Add the brand too, so we can find the right product.
  analyseBusyLabel: "Searching\u2026"
  msgNoListFound: No trustworthy ingredient list was found for this product. Scan
    the list or type it in.
  msgNoListCheckingFda: No ingredient list found yet. Checking the FDA Philippines
    list...
  msgNoListButFda: No published ingredient list was found. {0} Scan the list on the
    pack, or type it in.
  fdaSaysRegistered: 'FDA Philippines: registered.'
  fdaSaysExpired: 'FDA Philippines: its registration has expired.'
  fdaSaysSimilar: 'FDA Philippines has a similar record: check the name.'
  fdaSaysNone: No FDA Philippines record was found either.
  loadingMessage: Scanning and analysing your product
  manualPanel: {fileID: 2078528550}
  manualInput: {fileID: 241585551}
  manualProductInput: {fileID: 1123106678}
  manualBrandDropdown: {fileID: 723596702}
  manualBrandNone: Brand
  manualTypeDropdown: {fileID: 84133930}
  manualTypeNone: Cosmetic type
  manualTypes:
  - Lipstick
