  - Mask
  - Skincare
  manualAnalyseButton: {fileID: 643698534}
  manualFeedbackText: {fileID: 53172693}
  msgPhotoModeHint: Frame the front of the pack, then tap capture.
  adminAngleHints:
  - 'Angle 1 of 3: the FRONT. Hold the phone straight on, 15 to 25 cm away, so the
    brand and the product name fill the frame. Avoid glare, then tap capture.'
  - 'Angle 2 of 3: the BACK or SIDE with the INGREDIENT LIST. Keep the text flat
    and sharp, tilt the pack away from the light if it shines, then tap capture.'
  - 'Angle 3 of 3: the BARCODE. Line the bars up straight inside the frame, then
    tap capture. (The live scan reads a barcode too.)'
  msgAdminAnglesDone: All three angles taken. The product is registered in the catalogue
    as soon as the read is done. Capture again to add another angle.
  msgAdminLiveHint: 'Admin: the product is added to the catalogue after the scan.
    Hold the list flat in the frame; use the camera button for the front, back and
    barcode angles.'
  liveScanLabel: Live scan
  photoMatchesMessageCatalogue: Tap your product. If it is not here, choose None
    of these, then type it in.
  msgBarcodeLookingUp: "Looking the barcode up on Open Beauty Facts\u2026"
  msgBarcodeUnclear: The barcode was only partly read. Pick your product, or choose
    None of these.
